      "writtenOn": "2022-08-09T08:22:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately I can\u0027t edit it now that it\u0027s autosubmitted :(\n\nBut the java_sdk_library (for framework-connectivity-t) is a combined build rule that generates both stubs (framework-connectivity-t.stubs.eachapilevel), and implementation library (framework-connectivity-t.impl). See: https://source.android.com/devices/architecture/java-library\n\nThis patch edits the \"stub_only_libs\" used by java_sdk_library, so that\u0027s the libs used to generate the stubs.\n\nOne thing to keep in mind is that java_sdk_library uses \"stub_only_libs\" to generate the stub source, but uses \"libs\" to compile them\n\nNote I filed b/227269567 to get this clarified a while back.",
      "parentUuid": "9118b183_d9321f58",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "startChar": 42,
        "endLine": 7,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "77d4c4efa87321d85f482b7bd9e5779f20b28690",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cbdf8f29_ac9dc581",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 25,
